.	http://www.emsl.pnl.gov/ecce:annotation		Quantum ESPRESSO, PBE-D3(BJ), plane waves (60 Ry), 2x2x2 k-points, single point (scf). This calculation shows a molecular crystal of sugar molecules joined by a network of O-H...O hydrogen bonds between their hydroxyl groups. Structure: sucrose (P21, 100 K), COD 7244614 (X-ray wavefunction refinement, RSC Adv. 2022).
